<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>NGS Panel Lookup</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#f4f4fb;
    --card-bg:#ffffff;
    --line:#dcdcee;
    --text:#20223f;
    --dim:#6d6f92;
    --opa:#7a5fd6;
    --oca:#2f7fd4;
    --cch:#b martin;
    --cch2:#b04fc0;
    --odp:#c2841f;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0}
  body{
    background:
      radial-gradient(820px 460px at 10% -10%, #e7e2fb 0%, transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(680px 400px at 95% 2%, #dfeafb 0%, transparent 58%),
      var(--bg);
    background-attachment:fixed;
    color:var(--text);
    font-family:"Avenir Next","Segoe UI",system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;
    line-height:1.5;
    padding:34px 20px 70px;
    min-height:100vh;
  }
  .wrap{max-width:740px;margin:0 auto}
  header{margin-bottom:14px}
  h1{font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 5px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
  .sub{
    font-family:ui-monospace,"SF Mono",Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
    font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--dim);margin:0;
  }
  .rule{height:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--opa),var(--oca) 38%,var(--cch2) 70%,var(--odp));margin:0 0 24px;opacity:.85;border-radius:2px}

  input[type=text]{
    width:100%;
    font-family:ui-monospace,"SF Mono",Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
    font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    padding:17px 19px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:10px;
    background:var(--card-bg);
    color:var(--text);
    box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(32,34,63,.05);
  }
  input[type=text]:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--oca);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(47,127,212,.16)}
  input::placeholder{color:#a9aac6;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:.05em}

  .hint{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--dim);margin:11px 0 24px}

  .suggest{list-style:none;margin:4px 0 0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px}
  .suggest button{
    font-family:ui-monospace,"SF Mono",Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
    font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.06em;
    background:var(--card-bg);border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:6px;padding:6px 11px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--text);
    transition:.15s;
  }
  .suggest button:hover{background:var(--oca);border-color:var(--oca);color:#fff}

  .gene-title{
    font-family:ui-monospace,"SF Mono",Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
    font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;
    margin:28px 0 3px;
  }
  .verdict{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--dim);margin:0 0 20px}

  .panel{
    background:var(--card-bg);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-left:4px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:14px 17px;
    margin-bottom:11px;
    box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(32,34,63,.04);
  }
  .panel.hit-opa{border-left-color:var(--opa)}
  .panel.hit-oca{border-left-color:var(--oca)}
  .panel.hit-cch{border-left-color:var(--cch2)}
  .panel.hit-odp{border-left-color:var(--odp)}
  .panel.miss{opacity:.5;box-shadow:none}

  .pname{
    font-size:.94rem;font-weight:600;margin:0;
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;
  }
  .pcode{
    font-family:ui-monospace,"SF Mono",Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
    font-size:.66rem;letter-spacing:.11em;text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--dim);font-weight:400;white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:9px}
  .tag{
    font-family:ui-monospace,"SF Mono",Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
    font-size:.67rem;letter-spacing:.06em;
    padding:4px 9px;border-radius:5px;border:1px solid;
  }
  .tag.hot{color:#5a42ab;border-color:#c9bdf1;background:#f0ecfd}
  .tag.exon{color:#1f5f9e;border-color:#b8d4f0;background:#eaf3fc}
  .tag.cnv{color:#8b3a98;border-color:#e5bfea;background:#faeffb}
  .tag.fus{color:#1f7a70;border-color:#b3ddd7;background:#eaf7f5}
  .tag.loh{color:#96650f;border-color:#e8cf9e;background:#fdf5e6}
  .none{
    font-family:ui-monospace,"SF Mono",Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
    font-size:.71rem;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--dim);
    display:inline-block;margin-top:8px;
  }

  .note{
    margin-top:30px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    font-size:.79rem;color:var(--dim);
  }
  .note b{color:var(--text);font-weight:600}
  .note p{margin:0 0 7px}
  .empty{color:var(--dim);font-size:.9rem;margin-top:26px}
  footer{
    margin-top:22px;padding-top:13px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;
    font-family:ui-monospace,"SF Mono",Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
    font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;
    color:#9799b8;
  }
  @media (max-width:520px){
    input[type=text]{font-size:1.1rem}
    .gene-title{font-size:1.4rem}
    .pname{flex-direction:column;gap:3px}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

<header>
  <h1>NGS Panel Lookup</h1>
  <p class="sub">OPA &middot; OCA v3 GX &middot; Oncomine Childhood &middot; OncoDEEP</p>
</header>
<div class="rule"></div>

<input type="text" id="q" placeholder="Enter a gene..." autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" autofocus>
<p class="hint">Search by symbol (TP53, CDKN2A, IDH1) to see which panel covers it and how.</p>

<div id="out"></div>

<div class="note">
  <p><b>Sensitivity:</b> point variants VAF &ge;5% &middot; CNV &ge;6 copies with tumour cellularity &gt;50% &middot; fusions &ge;20 reads and &gt;0.1% of total mapped reads.</p>
  <p><b>OncoDEEP</b> is a capture-based exonic assay: all 638 genes are covered for SNV/INDEL, CNV and LOH. Fusions are only detected when the rearrangement falls within captured exonic regions. It also reports HRD, TMB and MSI.</p>
  <p>Targeted panels do not provide genome-wide methylation class or chromosomal copy number profile.</p>
</div>

<footer>
  <span>v1.0 &middot; Aug 2026 &middot; GC</span>
  <span>Panel content per manufacturer specifications (Thermo Fisher Scientific)</span>
</footer>

</div>

